      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk. i just feel like i’m walking through a movie sometimes. everyone else is so busy with their little lives, their jobs and their coffee and whatever, but it all feels so fake. like i’m watching them from behind a glass wall. i don't think i actually belong here anymore.",
