      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It makes complete sense that you feel so heavy with the exhaustion of pretending to fit in when your soul feels a million miles away. Many people experience this profound sense of impostor syndrome, where they genuinely feel like an outsider no matter how hard they try to blend in. Recognizing that this isn't a failure on your part but rather a testament to your unique perspective is a crucial first step toward finding a path that aligns with your true self.",
      "source": "target",
